{
  "id": "ch02_s05_yeting",
  "chapter": 2,
  "act": 2,
  "scene": "yeting",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "songhuizhen"
  ],
  "weightless": true,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "两人只是把帕子折来折去，不谈旧事",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch02_s05_yeting.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "帘下漏进一小块日光，正照着帕子翘起的角。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s05_yeting.l2",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "换这边。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s05_yeting.l3",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "换过了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s05_yeting.l4",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我没看见，再换一回。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s05_yeting.l5",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你转了半圈，宋按住另一角。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s05_yeting.l6",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这回是你那边长。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s05_yeting.l7",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我的手还没动呢，你先别赖我；松开一点，我瞧瞧底下压了什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s05_yeting.l8",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "两人一起松手，帕子摊开，折痕全朝不同方向。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s05_yeting.l9",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "更皱了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s05_yeting.l10",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那就卷。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s05_yeting.l11",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你压着的那个角一直在外头，卷起来也看得见；不如让它在外头待着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s05_yeting.l12",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好，叫它晒着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s05_yeting.l13",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她把帕子放在光里。你收回手，掌心还留着一道折印。"
    }
  ],
  "goto": "ch02_s06_yeting"
}
